    "body": "Closes https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/7989",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-20T11:03:01Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7990#discussion_r3996924507"
                },
                "pull_request": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/cython/cython/pulls/7990"
                },
                "self": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/cython/cython/pulls/comments/3996924507"
                }
            },
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It's usually not enough to test a single case since it cannot validate that the code actually does something (other than returning the expected value).\nAlso, to allow for type inference, it's best to assign the result to an untyped variable first.\n```suggestion\ndef clamp(exponent, maximum=16):\n    \"\"\"\n    >>> clamp(-4)\n    1\n    >>> clamp(4)\n    16\n    >>> clamp('3')\n    8\n    \"\"\"\n    result = min(max(2 ** int(exponent), 1), maximum)\n    return result\n\n\ndef equal_powers(left, right):\n    \"\"\"\n    >>> equal_powers(-4, -4)\n    True\n    >>> equal_powers(-4, 4)\n    False\n    >>> equal_powers(3, 3)\n    True\n    \"\"\"\n    result = 2 ** int(left) == 2 ** int(right)\n    return result\n```",
            "commit_id": "5db3f381c377517489d7876507f26a4fb187c1c8",
            "created_at": "2026-09-12T17:00:46Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -175,3 +175,19 @@ def optimised_pow2_inplace(n):\n     x = 2\n     x **= n\n     return x\n+\n+\n+def clamp(exponent, maximum=16):\n+    \"\"\"\n+    >>> clamp(-4)\n+    1\n+    \"\"\"\n+    return min(max(2 ** int(exponent), 1), maximum)\n+\n+\n+def equal_powers(left, right):\n+    \"\"\"\n+    >>> equal_powers(-4, -4)\n+    True\n+    \"\"\"\n+    return 2 ** int(left) == 2 ** int(right)",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7990#discussion_r3996924507",
            "id": 3996924507,
